libudev-zero is a small daemonless replacement for libudev: it provides the libudev
API (device enumeration, properties, hotplug monitor) from sysfs and kernel uevents,
with no udevd needed. libinput and other input libraries link against it. Installs
libudev.so.1, libudev.h and libudev.pc under /usr/local.
upstream: https://github.com/illiliti/libudev-zero
